    "title": "Dog lost in crash near Spencer last month will be reunited with its owner - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rett Nelson, EastIdahoNews.com ,\n13 hours ago SPENCER – A woman from Canada will reunite with her dog this weekend following a crash in Spencer last month. The 77-year-old woman, who wasn’t identified by law enforcement, was traveling with her husband along Interstate 15 near Spencer on Oct. 23. Clark County Sheriff Mark McClure told EastIdahoNews.com at the time that the couple was tired. Around 5:15 p.m., they approached milepost 182 about two miles north of Spencer and veered off the road. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
